@startuml product-agentic-realization-boundary
title Product / Agentic Product Realization Boundary , per ADR-ES-016 §1 + §2 + §3

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Product" as P
class "Agentic Product" as AP
class "Material Agentic Realization" as MAR

P <|-- AP : specializes
AP *-- MAR : material-evidence

class "Intent Interpretation" as II
class "Contextual Interpretation" as CI
class "Dynamic Action Selection" as DAS
class "Agentic Coordination" as AC
class "Contextual Adaptation" as CA
class "Exception Interpretation" as EI
class "Bounded Decision-Making" as BDM
class "Escalation" as Esc

MAR --> II
MAR --> CI
MAR --> DAS
MAR --> AC
MAR --> CA
MAR --> EI
MAR --> BDM
MAR --> Esc

note bottom of MAR
  Material agentic realization requires substantive evidence
  in one or more of the listed dimensions per ADR-ES-016 §6.
end note

@enduml
